ShareX Mac is an independent, unofficial native macOS implementation of the
screenshot, OCR, history, settings, and hotkey subset requested from ShareX.

Upstream project: https://github.com/ShareX/ShareX
Upstream license: GNU General Public License version 3 (see LICENSE).

The native Swift implementation and its icon were authored for this repository.
No Windows binaries, upload services, or upstream ShareX artwork are bundled.
